ce of learning and teaching.<\/li>\n<li>To enrich local schools and communities through value-added interactions.<\/li>\n<li>To prepare students not just for their first job, but their LAST job as well.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Values<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Meritocracy;<\/li>\n<li>Unparalleled quality and excellence;<\/li>\n<li>Honesty, integrity, sincerity, and devotion;<\/li>\n<li>Trust and freedom with accountability;<\/li>\n<li>Appreciation and celebration of creativity;<\/li>\n<li>Willingness to try new ideas and allow mistakes;<\/li>\n<li>Social and moral responsibility;<\/li>\n<li>Respect for every individual and diversity; and<\/li>\n<li>Co-operation, collaboration, and teamwork.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","public_url":"c\/indian-institute-of-technology-iit-gandhinagar-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-14571","logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners75\/5d1da228cb542_220px-IIT_Gandhinagar_Logo.svg.png","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners125\/5d1da228cb542_220px-IIT_Gandhinagar_Logo.svg.png","organisation_type":"3","wp_tag":753,"seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/c\/indian-institute-of-technology-iit-gandhinagar-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-14571","website":"https:\/\/www.iitgn.ac.in\/","extra_fields":"{\"industry\":\"\",\"founder\":\"\",\"foundedOn\":\"2008\",\"keyPeople\":\"Sudhir K. Jain \",\"headquarter\":\"Gandhinagar\",\"founderUrl\":\"\"}"},"rounds":[{"id":1636615,"opportunity_id":1765311,"entity_id":485198,"entity_type":"App\\Models\\AssessmentRound\\AssessmentRound","is_inactive":0,"is_hidden":0,"evaluation_fields":"{\"fields\":[{\"label\":\"Gets Results\",\"comments\":\"\",\"score\":\"\",\"info\":\"\"},{\"label\":\"Leadership & Communication Skills\",\"comments\":\"\",\"score\":\"\",\"info\":\"\"},{\"label\":\"Managing Stakeholders\",\"comments\":\"\",\"score\":\"\",\"info\":\"\"},{\"label\":\"Decision Making\",\"comments\":\"\",\"score\":\"\",\"in